791	     * Populates an owner's {@code membershipPoints} and {@code membershipLevel} on the given
792	     * dto, sizing the owner's household from all owners so the household-of-three-or-more
793	     * factor is scored correctly. Use {@link #applyMembership(OwnerDto, Owner, Map)} instead
794	     * when mapping a collection to size every household from a single scan.
795	     *
796	     * @param ownerDto the dto to populate
797	     * @param owner    the owner being mapped
